ot treat model backends as additional coding-agent adapters.","limitations","What the source actually contains","Verified Python solve/judge/record pipeline, container/egress code, and separate claude_code.py, codex.py, and opencode.py adapters. The public GameLogicBench-Tasks repository is a separate dependency and contains the game/task/judge/reference content.","codeScope","Code type","Implementation","codeType","links","Evidence","items",[79],"evidenceUrl",{"_50":75,"_25":80},"https://github.com/NJU-LINK/GameLogicBench/blob/main/docs/running.md","Code / instructions",[84],"codeUrl",{"_50":81,"_25":85},"https://github.com/NJU-LINK/GameLogicBench/tree/main/geb","Primary source",[89],"sourceUrl",{"_50":86,"_25":90},"https://github.com/NJU-LINK/GameLogicBench","Engine / runtime","Godot","engine","list","Attributed clients / models","ordered",false,[100,101,102],"agents","Claude Code","Codex","OpenCode","Toolkit category","Development evaluations","lead","summary","evaluation",[110,111,112],"implementation","claude-code","codex","opencode",{"_114":115},"documents",{"_116":117,"_118":119},"en",[121,125,126,127,124,128,129,130,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,123,160,122,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181],"zh",[120,121,122,123,124],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visua